{{Quote|The capital of Kashyyyk, Kachirho sprawls along the shoreline of the tropical Wawaatt Archipelago.|The ''[[Galactic Explorer's Guide]]''|<ref name="GE Guide">''[[Star Wars: The Galactic Explorer's Guide]]''</ref>}}
The '''Wawaatt Archipelago''' was a group of islands on the [[planet]] of [[Kashyyyk]]. It notably contained the coastal [[city]] of [[Kachirho]].<ref name="Ultimate" /> During the [[Battle of Kashyyyk]], [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] [[Confederacy military|forces]] occupied the Archipelago,<ref name="Complete Vehicles 2018">[[Star Wars: Complete Vehicles (2018)|''Star Wars: Complete Vehicles'' (2018)]]</ref> but Kachirho remained under Wookiee and [[Galactic Republic]] control.<ref name="RotS">{{Film|III}}</ref>

